<span data-as="p">If you use <a class="link" href="/docs/guides/overview/auth/byok">Bring Your Own Key (BYOK)</a> and want to maximize usage of your own API keys, <code>partition: &quot;none&quot;</code> can help. When your primary model doesn’t have a BYOK provider available, OpenRouter can route to a fallback model that does support BYOK.</span>
